flowchart LR
    user[You: CLI or web upload]
    server[arti-server]
    pg[(Postgres: metadata + small text)]
    s3[(S3 / MinIO: large bytes, zips, files)]
    link[Canonical link /s slug or /a uuid]
    viewer[Viewer or fetcher opens the link]

    user -->|upload content| server
    server -->|row + version| pg
    server -->|blob ref| s3
    server -->|returns| link
    link --> viewer
    viewer -->|read| server
